{"seq":2,"slug":"wheeled-tracked","title":"轮式与履带式平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/wheeled-tracked","wordCount":1409,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"轮式与履带式平台\">轮式与履带式平台</h1><p>把同一套 SLAM 与导航栈分别装到一台仓储 AGV、一台火星车和一台搜救履带车上，软件可以高度复用，但它们能跨越的地形天差地别。原因不在算法，而在底盘与地面之间那几平方厘米接触区里发生的力学。本篇聚焦轮式与履带式平台的硬件形态、地面力学（terramechanics）与适用边界——它们的纯运动学方程已在 <a href=\"mobile-kinematics\">移动机器人运动学</a> 给出，这里不再重复推导，而把腿式作为对照引出后续章节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>移动平台的选择本质是一道在<strong>效率、地形通过性、复杂度</strong>之间的三角权衡。轮子在硬质平整地面上能量效率最高，但接触面积小、易陷软土；履带把接触摊成一条长带，降低接地压强、提升越障，却以滚动阻力和转向能耗为代价；腿式接触离散、可主动选择落足点，能上下楼梯、跨越壕沟，但机构复杂、能耗高、控制难。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[平台选型] --&gt; B[轮式]&#10;  A --&gt; C[履带式]&#10;  A --&gt; D[腿式]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[硬地高效&lt;br/&gt;结构简单]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[软土易陷&lt;br/&gt;越障弱]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[接地压强低&lt;br/&gt;越障强]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[滚动阻力大&lt;br/&gt;转向磨损]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[离散落足&lt;br/&gt;地形通过性最强]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[机构复杂&lt;br/&gt;能耗高 控制难]&#10;  D1 --&gt; E[后续章节: 腿足机器人]\">flowchart TD\n  A[平台选型] --&gt; B[轮式]\n  A --&gt; C[履带式]\n  A --&gt; D[腿式]\n  B --&gt; B1[硬地高效&lt;br/&gt;结构简单]\n  B --&gt; B2[软土易陷&lt;br/&gt;越障弱]\n  C --&gt; C1[接地压强低&lt;br/&gt;越障强]\n  C --&gt; C2[滚动阻力大&lt;br/&gt;转向磨损]\n  D --&gt; D1[离散落足&lt;br/&gt;地形通过性最强]\n  D --&gt; D2[机构复杂&lt;br/&gt;能耗高 控制难]\n  D1 --&gt; E[后续章节: 腿足机器人]</pre><p>下表用关键指标对比三类平台，量化&quot;为什么没有万能底盘&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>轮式</th>\n<th>履带式</th>\n<th>腿式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平地能效（运输成本 COT）</td>\n<td>最低（最好）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最高（最差）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接地压强</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（足端可调）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>越障/台阶能力</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机械复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型速度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（已可达 5 m/s 级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制难度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>高（动态平衡）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"接地力学-压强-沉陷与挂钩牵引力\">接地力学：压强、沉陷与挂钩牵引力</h2><p>平台能否在软地上前进，取决于地面力学三件事。第一是<strong>接地压强</strong>：履带把车重分摊到长接触带，压强可比同重量轮式低数倍，因而不易在沙土、雪地里沉陷。第二是<strong>沉陷-牵引关系</strong>，常用 Bekker-Wong 模型描述压强 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 与沉陷量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = \\left(\\frac{k_c}{b} + k_\\phi\\right) z^{\\,n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为接触宽度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_c, k_\\phi, n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为土壤参数。第三是<strong>挂钩牵引力（drawbar pull）</strong>，即推进力减去运动阻力后真正可用于牵引/爬坡的力。火星车这类在松软风化层上作业的平台，正是靠大接触面与低速来压住沉陷、保住挂钩牵引力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转向方式与机动性\">转向方式与机动性</h2><p>轮式平台的转向已在运动学篇按差速、阿克曼、全向分类。履带式几乎都采用<strong>滑移转向（skid steering）</strong>：左右履带异速甚至反转，靠履带与地面的横向滑动实现转弯。它无需转向机构、能原地转，但转向时整条履带都在刮地，能耗与磨损大，且转向中心会随地面摩擦漂移，给里程计带来显著误差——这也是履带平台尤其依赖外部传感融合做定位的原因，相关方法见 <a href=\"localization-odometry\">定位与里程计</a>。</p>\n<p>为兼顾通过性与机动性，工程上出现了大量混合形态：腿-轮混合（如轮足机器人在足端装驱动轮）、可变形履带（关节式履带臂主动改变形状翻越台阶）、以及轮腿可切换底盘。它们的共同思路是用机构复杂度换取地形适应范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"典型平台与适用场景\">典型平台与适用场景</h2><p>不同任务把权衡推向不同角落。下面用几类真实平台说明选型逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>仓储 AGV / 全向叉车</strong>：地面平整、追求吞吐与能效，几乎全是轮式（差速或麦克纳姆）。</li>\n<li><strong>行星探测车</strong>：松软风化层、低速、可靠性优先，多采用六轮摇臂转向架（rocker-bogie）这种被动适应地形的轮式悬挂。</li>\n<li><strong>搜救 / 排爆机器人</strong>：废墟、楼梯、碎石，履带或关节履带臂占主导，牺牲速度换通过性。</li>\n<li><strong>巡检四足 / 人形</strong>：需要上下楼梯、跨越管线、进入为人设计的环境，这正是腿式不可替代的领域，留待 <a href=\"../legged/\">腿足机器人</a> 展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么还需要腿\">为什么还需要腿</h2><p>如果轮式如此高效、履带如此能越障，为何业界仍在大举投入腿足与人形机器人？关键在&quot;为人类设计的世界&quot;：楼梯、门槛、不连续的落脚点，对连续接触的轮履是天然障碍，对可离散选择落足点的腿却是常态。截至 2026 年，Unitree、Boston Dynamics 等四足平台已能在工厂巡检中稳定运行，奔跑速度进入 5 m/s 量级；人形机器人则因能直接复用人类工具与工作空间而被视为通用劳动力的候选形态（详见 <a href=\"../applications/humanoid-robots\">人形机器人</a>）。轮履与腿式不是替代关系，而是按地形与任务分工——理解这套力学权衡，才能读懂后续章节为何要为腿式付出巨大的动态平衡与控制代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>平台选型是效率、地形通过性、机械复杂度之间的三角权衡，没有万能底盘。</li>\n<li>接地压强、Bekker-Wong 沉陷模型与挂钩牵引力决定平台能否在软地前进。</li>\n<li>履带普遍用滑移转向：能原地转但磨损大、转向中心漂移，定位更依赖多传感融合。</li>\n<li>腿-轮混合、可变形履带等形态用机构复杂度换取更宽的地形适应范围。</li>\n<li>腿式不可替代之处在于&quot;为人设计的世界&quot;里离散、不连续的落足需求。</li>\n<li>本篇的力学权衡是理解后续腿足为何值得付出动态控制代价的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"轮式与履带式平台","id":"轮式与履带式平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"接地力学：压强、沉陷与挂钩牵引力","id":"接地力学-压强-沉陷与挂钩牵引力"},{"level":2,"text":"转向方式与机动性","id":"转向方式与机动性"},{"level":2,"text":"典型平台与适用场景","id":"典型平台与适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么还需要腿","id":"为什么还需要腿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"移动机器人运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/mobile-kinematics"},"next":{"title":"定位与里程计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/localization-odometry"}}